      "description": "Signup/login is OTP-first: Send OTP -> Verify OTP (new users get a setPasswordTicket) -> Set Password, then Login with mobile/email + password. Login and Refresh Token auto-save {{accessToken}}/{{refreshToken}} via their Tests scripts."
